ation.js  |  Accounts: accounts.js  |  Projects: projects.js&#xa;Store: store.js  |  Email: gmail.js  |  Cryptography: security.js&#xa;Charts: src/report-data.js  |  Pagination: src/bug-register-data.js&#xa;Persistence services share the same SQLite connection. Dashed arrows denote dependencies." style="html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;fontColor=#24364b;strokeColor=#718299;strokeWidth=1.2;fillColor=#fff9eb;shape=note;size=16;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;strokeColor=#d5bb7b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1100" width="1340" height="115" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>